{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_1","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"師古曰：「此表中記公卿姓名不具及但舉其官而無名或言若干年不載遷免死者，皆史之闕文，不可得知。」","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_2","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"百官公卿表第七","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_3","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"校勘記","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_4","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"七五一頁　一欄　三格「十年」據景祐、殿本補。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_5","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"七五三頁　三欄　四格原在三格，據景祐、殿、局本移下。王先謙說「窋」訛「窟」。按局本作「窋」。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_6","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"七五四頁　三欄　四格原在五格，據景祐、殿、局本移上。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_7","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"七五九頁　三欄　二格「倉」，殿本作「蒼」。王先謙說作「蒼」是。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_8","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"七六二頁　一欄　六格「奉常」據景祐、殿本補。　王先謙說蓋盎免而殷代也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_9","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"七六四頁　一欄　十三格，王先謙說中尉都三年方免，此處不應有「中尉」二字。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_10","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"七六五頁　三欄　二格，王先謙說「死」為「免」字之訛。　按殿本作「免」。四格，王先謙說「死」亦「免」之誤。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_11","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"七六六頁　四欄　二格，王先謙說「後」字蓋衍。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_12","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"七六九頁　一欄　九格，王先謙說「年」下脫「遷」字。　按各本都脫。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_13","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"七七一頁　一欄　八格，王先謙說「都」當為「衛」。　按景祐、殿本都作「衛」。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_14","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"七七五頁　二欄　十四格，王先謙說「陽」當為「楊」。　按景祐、殿本都作「楊」。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_15","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"七七九頁　二欄　十二格，王先謙說「為」字衍。　按景祐、殿本無。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_16","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"七八三頁　三欄　十三格，王先謙說「中尉」衍文。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_17","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"七八六頁　二欄　十五格原在十四格，據景祐、殿本移下。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_18","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"七九四頁　二欄　十格，王先謙說「道」是「首」之誤字。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_19","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"七九五頁　二欄　六格「夜郎」，景祐、殿本都作「郎夜」。　王先謙說「郎」在「夜」上是。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_20","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"七九七頁　一欄　二格，殿本考證說「相」上脫「丞」字。　按景祐本有。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_21","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"七九八頁　一欄　十格，殿本「加」作「邢」。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_22","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八００頁　二欄　十五格，王先謙說「田」是「尹」之誤。　按景祐、局本都作「尹」。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_23","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八０二頁　二欄　十四格，沈欽韓說「為」字衍。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_24","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八０三頁　一欄　三格，錢大昭說「農」當為「馬」。　按景祐、殿、局本都作「馬」。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_25","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八０九頁　二欄　四格據景祐、殿本補。錢大昭說閩本有。六格原在五格，八格原在七格，據景祐、殿本移下。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_26","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八一一頁　三欄　二格「二」，景祐、殿本都作「三」。王先謙說作「三」是。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_27","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八一二頁　三欄　十五格據景祐、殿本補。錢大昭說閩本有。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_28","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八一三頁　二欄　十四格，殿本有「馮奉世」三字，考證說從宋本補。　按景祐本無此三字。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_29","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八一七頁　一欄　十二格原在十一格，據景祐、殿、局本移下。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_30","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八二０頁　四欄　四格，錢大昭說「光祿」下脫「勳」字。　按各本都脫。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_31","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八二一頁　二欄　四格「縏」，王先謙說殿本作「繁」是。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_32","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八二二頁　一欄　十四格「謂」，景祐、殿、局本都作「為」。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_33","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八二二頁　三欄　四格，沈欽韓說史表作「三月」，「七月」是傳寫之誤。　按景祐本正作「三月」。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_34","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八二三頁　三欄　十五格，「尊」字據景祐、殿本補。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_35","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八三０頁　二欄　十三格，景祐、殿本都作「域」，「城」字誤。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_36","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八三六頁　一欄　十五格「寵」，景祐、殿本都作「龐」。王先謙說作「龐」是。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_37","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八四０頁　二欄　七格「亡」，景祐、殿本都作「玄」。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_38","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八四一頁　二欄　八格「湯」，景祐、殿、局本都作「陽」。　王先謙說作「陽」。十三格「中陵」，景祐、殿本都作「平陵」。　王先謙說作「平陵」是。十四格「州」，景祐、殿本都作「水」。　王先謙說作「水」是。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_39","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八四七頁　一欄　五格「嶠」，景祐、殿本都作「蟜」。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_40","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八五０頁　二欄　一格，景祐、殿本無「二」字。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_41","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八五二頁　一欄　一格「三」，景祐、殿本都作「二」。　周壽昌說孝哀崩於元壽二年，無三年。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_42","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八五二頁　一欄　六格「都」，景祐、殿本都作「郡」。　王先謙說作「郡」是。","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_22_43","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_22","textTraditional":"八五五頁　二欄　四格，王先謙說「病」上「為」字衍，「府」當作「傅」。","sentenceOrder":43}],"overrides":{}}